msgid "Mailing queue"
msgstr ""

#: ../command-line.rst:205
msgid "When :ref:`sending limits <mail_throttling>` are configured, mass mailings and reminders are queued rather than sent in one go. This command drains what is pending:"
msgstr ""

#: ../command-line.rst:220
msgid "Nothing is sent until that question is answered. Pass ``--force`` to skip it, which is what an unattended run needs: without it, a non-interactive call has no way to confirm and stops with an error rather than send."
msgstr ""

#: ../command-line.rst:226
msgid "For more complete documentation, see :ref:`draining the mail queue <mailing_queue_cron>`, and the :ref:`progress page <mailing_queue>` it drains alongside."
msgstr ""

